  "priorExpiration": "2020-03-23",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 4091.02 Quantities for Use with Decommissioning for Natural Thorium and Uranium. The quantities for use with decommissioning for Natural thorium and Natural Uranium shall be as follows:\n\n(a) Thorium-Natural shall be based on the alpha disintegration rate from Thorium-232, Thorium-230,and their daughter products; and\n\n(b) Uranium-Natural shall be based on the alpha disintegration rate of Uranium-238, Uranium-234, and Uranium-235.\n\nSource. #7960, eff 9-20-03; ss by #9981, eff 9-20-11; ss by#12874, INTERIM, eff 9-25-19, EXPIRED: 3-23-20\n\nNew. #13062, eff 6-25-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p4062-4097.html"
